    "type": "game",
    "name": "Salvage Shop Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3555500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Salvage Shop Simulator, you take on the role of a shop owner trading in reclaimed goods!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/extras/6a61d5ad3a72afb8a93d80ce60d1942e.poster.avif?t=1752670769\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/extras/6a61d5ad3a72afb8a93d80ce60d1942e.webm?t=1752670769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your goal is to acquire inventory by participating in exciting container auctions, where each container has been salvaged from the water. Before each auction, you have only 10 seconds to take a quick look inside and assess whether it holds anything valuable. Then, you compete against NPC bidders, trying to secure the best items at the lowest possible price. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you win an auction, it\u2019s time to clean and restore your newly acquired items. Each product needs proper preparation before being placed on your store\u2019s shelves. Well-presented and polished items will attract more customers, increasing your chances of making a bigger profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The money you earn can be spent not only on new auctions but also on upgrading your shop. Invest in better equipment, decorations, and more retail space to attract even more customers and grow your business. Do you have a keen eye for deals and the ability to spot valuable finds among reclaimed goods? Test your skills in the Salvage Shop Simulator!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Salvage Shop Simulator, you take on the role of a shop owner trading in reclaimed goods!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/extras/6a61d5ad3a72afb8a93d80ce60d1942e.poster.avif?t=1752670769\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/extras/6a61d5ad3a72afb8a93d80ce60d1942e.webm?t=1752670769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your goal is to acquire inventory by participating in exciting container auctions, where each container has been salvaged from the water. Before each auction, you have only 10 seconds to take a quick look inside and assess whether it holds anything valuable. Then, you compete against NPC bidders, trying to secure the best items at the lowest possible price. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you win an auction, it\u2019s time to clean and restore your newly acquired items. Each product needs proper preparation before being placed on your store\u2019s shelves. Well-presented and polished items will attract more customers, increasing your chances of making a bigger profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The money you earn can be spent not only on new auctions but also on upgrading your shop. Invest in better equipment, decorations, and more retail space to attract even more customers and grow your business. Do you have a keen eye for deals and the ability to spot valuable finds among reclaimed goods? Test your skills in the Salvage Shop Simulator!</p>",
    "short_description": "Enter the world of shopkeepers trading in reclaimed goods! Bid for the best items at auction, prepare and clean the bought items, and then sell them in your shop. Test your skills and watch your business grow!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Hungarian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
